content='''<p class="eyebrow">Exact analytical construction</p><h1>Nineteen qubits: maximum pure-state AC order four</h1><p>A five-component radical state proves that a fourth-order anticoherent line exists. Its fourth reduced state is exactly maximally mixed.</p>'''
