content+='<p>Support gaps eliminate magnetic shifts one through three. At shift four, the three contributions have lengths</p>'+math(r'a=\frac{1197\sqrt{27170}}{320},\quad b=\frac{15561\sqrt{2310}}{1600},\quad c=\frac{513\sqrt{1547}}{32}.')
