content+='<p>The remaining fourth-shift condition is the exact identity</p>'+math(r'au+b+cv=0.')+'<p>Together these equations prove full fourth-order anticoherence.</p><h2>Independent verification and scope</h2><p>Exact fractions and squarefree radicals reconstruct all 54 reduced-state entries through order four. The next reduction gives</p>'+math(r'\left\|\rho_5-I_6/6\right\|_F^2=\frac{8742251}{10653696000}>0.')
content+='<p>This representative has exactly order four. The separately certified fifth-order exclusion proves this order globally optimal. The <a href="exclusion/index.html">Young-space positive-moment certificate</a> excludes every two-dimensional fourth-order AC subspace. Exact polynomial factorization also verifies 19 distinct Majorana points; the sphere coordinates are numerical renderings.</p><h2>Files</h2><ul>'
